{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_6_level_main_06-04_beg",
  "groupId": "main_6",
  "stageId": "main_06-04",
  "title": "Festering Scars",
  "storyCode": "6-4",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "363eae5fa9713c4ab3518d47d3fd0b76c98767c958fb85e6a336ad5d90100ae4",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第四关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Hurry! Get back! The Infected have turned into monsters!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Agh! I've been bit! I've been bit!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Herd",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Ung."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Herd",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Aaaahh!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Herd",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "(Terrifying screaming)."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "How could this happen...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "What has that nasty little boy done?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "Doctor, we need to move! We have to meet up with Amiya!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "A small fire team can't handle a herd of this size. We have to tread carefully!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "There's nothing we can do for the L. G. D. now. We're in a much worse position than them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "Set them aside. My top priority is to guarantee your safety."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "We're being overrun!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "We're dead if we don't retreat!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Don't panic."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Huh?! Who's...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "That uniform... You're..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "The cavalry is here. Stand firm."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Form two teams and move on their flanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "But, Master..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Trust me. While I cannot take action myself, this method will succeed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Execute a pincer attack, hold the enemy in place, and leave the stragglers to your reinforcements."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Herd",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Nnng... Ngaaaa!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "...Thank you, sir!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "If you hadn't come to help..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Behind you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "C- counterattack!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "It is no use."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Form up. And fall back."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Yes, sir!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "No, if we do that..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "We can't hold here. We have to find a way out..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Of course! The high ground! We move up the stairs and attack down into the corridor!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "...No. All we can do is hold. But at least we won't get cornered by this crowd of lunatics!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Right. Come about, gather up at each doorway, pull back the teams, and take a defensive formation! Hurry! Move!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Well done. I approve."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Sir, come with us!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "No need."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Go."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I will move on the ground."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "We can't hold them!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "All we have is piercing weapons, and they're useless against these things!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Captain",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Hold your ground!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Captain",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "We're the last line of defense for the civilians behind us!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Then what do we do?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Captain",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "We fight to the last man!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Captain",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Watch the Originium they're throwing. It corrodes your equipment, and some of them explode!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Ah...! They hit Ah Chung!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Captain",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Ah Chung, get back! You, move up! Don't let them through!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Herd",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Guuhhh."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Aaaaaagh! Th- they got me! They're eating me! Noo! Aaaaieeeee!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Captain",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Ah Yee!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "How embarrassing!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Zongguan Bailei Zhengfa, loose!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Herd",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Nnng...!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Captain",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Lightning Arts?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Captain",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "H- how... you wiped them all out in one bright flash?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "*Pant...* *pant...*"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I just said I would not act. Little did I know how incapable you are of protecting the masses."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "That I would be forced to take such action, it's humiliating!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Captain",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Madam Censor..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Censor",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Madam nothing! Were you not told to ignore my presence?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Captain",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "...We never thought..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Censor",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I found your spirit laudable. How disappointing it was to see you hopping about aimlessly, leaving me to do your work. Honestly, what were you doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Censor",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Now! To your place!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Captain",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "But you just said..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Censor",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Chop chop! How have you not learned to move with haste even after witnessing me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Censor",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Oh, but of course. You did not witness me. I did nothing. Is that clear?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Captain",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Crystal!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Censor",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "But if a single hair on the head of a single commoner comes to harm, you are all terminated. Even I must resign. We are all unemployed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Captain",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Y- yes, of course... We'll fight with all our strength."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Censor",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Very good. Now why are you just standing there? Move!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Censor",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "By the way...? Do you know those Black Cloaks?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Captain",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Black Cloak? What's that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Censor",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Get your eyes checked! Those people on the rooftops, wearing the billowing black cloaks."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Captain",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Apologies, Madam. What are you talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "Defenders, fan out!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Recon team, fall back! Hold firing position!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Are these Infected mutants messing with the radio waves? Our scouts could be in trouble."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "We can't hold them...! There's so many! Didn't you cut through a whole wave of these things back there? Why haven't you done that already?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "This is different!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "Hah. Leave it to this puk gaai Lung to be so useless right when we need her most!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Then why don't you show us what you can do!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "Drone!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Huh."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "SUPERINTENDENT CH'EN SAYS: RECON TEAM! FALL BACK! HOLD FIRING POSITION!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "How was that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "I said how was that?! Fire team, loose explosive bolts!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "What did you say?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Am I deaf now thanks to you?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Go. Use your talents to get the word out to the communications team at Originium Transciever Beta. Have them tell everyone: the herd is tough, hold your positions, minimize casualties, don't conserve firepower."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "You really are a *Lungmen profanity*!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "I can read your lips!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "(Mouthing the word 'diu')."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Sir!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "I can't hear you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "SIR!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Herd",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "(Din of roaring)."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Speak up!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "SIR!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Defender",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Use the bunker-busters! Hurry!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "It's quiet."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Sir."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Okay. I can hear you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Go ahead. Speak."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "We have... guests."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Already? They took the chance to infiltrate our unit, huh."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "I guess it's to be expected. They were never going to give us free rein."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Anyway, it doesn't change our plans. Let them see how strong Lungmen is."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "One more thing. I... I'm not sure how accurate the reports are."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Out with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Some units have reported sightings of individuals wearing black raincoats."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Reunion?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Thankfully no. We've seen evidence of them clashing with Reunion. And..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "And what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
